{{Basis}}

'''Sunne''' is one of the two [[wikipedia:deity|deities]] in [[Sunneism]] and the personification of the [[Sunne|star of the same name]]. He is male, representing masculinity, and is married to [[Mōna (goddess)|Mōna]], with whom he created [[Basis (Sunneism)|Basis]], the mortal realm. 

